DR. SANDMAN STRIKES AGAIN - 5TH VICTIM SUCCUMBED

The legend of Sandman is alive and well in Dreslawa. A fifth victim has fallen into a slumber while desperate parents cry for the state police to come to their aid. This tragedy-filled village hopes the culprit gets caught or has the decency to come forward. 

Besides the old folktale explanations, this mystery has not been solved by the residents or the old Dr. Hoffmann yet. He revealed in our last interview that there are odd marks on the victims' bodies, although their origin and purpose is still kept away from public knowledge — for his own benefit perhaps?

However, a new doctor is in town. A Dr. Traum came to Dreslawa late at night with a young daughter who he claims to have suffered from the same illness. He insists on having cured her with his independent research. 

I reached out for an interview, but from the little we have seen of them, the girl could hardly get a noise out of her throat, and she wobbled as she walked. The doctor has claimed these side effects will fade with time.

Odd timing to arrive for this gentleman, nevertheless a needed one. 

It shall be seen if Dr. Traum's methods prove successful. If so, this might be the beginning of a global medical miracle.


    -> END
